function brandMatch(rbrand,sel){if(!sel)return true;var rb=seNorm(String(rbrand||'')),sb=seNorm(String(sel||''));if(rb===sb||rb.indexOf(sb)>=0||sb.indexOf(rb)>=0)return true;
 var aliases={vw:'volkswagen',mercedes:'mercedes-benz','land-rover':'land rover','alfa-romeo':'alfa romeo','land rover':'land rover','alfa romeo':'alfa romeo',chevy:'chevrolet',jeep:'chrysler',mini:'bmw',polestar:'volvo',cupra:'seat',ds:'citroen',opel:'vauxhall',vauxhall:'opel',nissan:'infiniti',infiniti:'nissan',toyota:'lexus',lexus:'toyota',honda:'acura',acura:'honda',ford:'lincoln',lincoln:'ford',gm:'chevrolet',chevrolet:'gm',stellantis:'peugeot',peugeot:'stellantis',citroen:'stellantis',ds:'stellantis',opel:'stellantis',vauxhall:'stellantis',fiat:'stellantis',alfa:'stellantis',lancia:'stellantis',maserati:'stellantis',jeep:'stellantis',ram:'stellantis',dodge:'stellantis',chrysler:'stellantis'};
 var a1=aliases[rb]||rb,a2=aliases[sb]||sb;if(a1===a2)return true;return false;}
function powerOverlap2(rp,sp){if(!rp||rp==='-'||!sp||sp==='Toutes')return true;
 var rn=String(rp).replace(/[^0-9.]/g,''),sn=String(sp).replace(/[^0-9.]/g,'');
 if(!rn||!sn)return true;var r1=parseFloat(rn),s1=parseFloat(sn);
 if(isNaN(r1)||isNaN(s1))return true;
 var rm=String(rp).match(/(\d+)[^0-9]*(\d+)/),sm=String(sp).match(/(\d+)[^0-9]*(\d+)/);
 if(rm&&sm){var rlo=+rm[1],rhi=+rm[2],slo=+sm[1],shi=+sm[2];return !(rhi<slo||rlo>shi);}
 return Math.abs(r1-s1)<=25;}
function verifyAttribution(r,s){var warns=[],level='exact';
 if(s.brand&&!brandMatch(r.brand||'',s.brand)){warns.push('marque');level='partiel';}
 if(s.model){var rm=seNorm(cleanModel(r.models||'')),toks=modelTokens(s.model);
  if(toks.length&&!/multi|tous/i.test(rm)){var all=toks.every(function(t){return tmModel(rm,t);});if(!all){warns.push('modèle');level='partiel';}}}
 if(s.motor){var rmot=seNorm(String(r.motor||'')+' '+String(r.models||'')),t0=seNorm(s.motor).split(/[\s/]+/)[0];
  if(t0&&t0.length>1&&!/tous/i.test(rmot)&&rmot.indexOf(t0)<0&&!tmModel(rmot,t0)){warns.push('motorisation');level='partiel';}}
 if(s.power&&s.power!=='Toutes'){if(r.power&&r.power!=='-'&&!powerOverlap2(r.power,s.power)){warns.push('puissance');if(level==='exact')level='partiel';}}
 if(!warns.length)level='exact';else if(warns.length>=2)level='approx';
 return{level:level,warns:warns};}

